    "created_at": "2017-02-15T16:31:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-15T16:31:24Z",
    "body": "I don't have a strong opinion about what we should implement. I can see your point about this being a security bug in general, however, I think it's a rather low severity issue.\r\n\r\nMaybe there's at least a way to phrase the spec such that it captures the minimum guarantees all implementations give you? Absent of that, at least capturing what one implementation does would still be better imo.",
